      "MADAME WEBER: Call Herr Mozart! You call Herr Mozart immediately! This is insupportable!\nCONSTANZE: Mother, please!\nMADAME WEBER: Go ahead, Constanze. Just ignore this fellow. Go ahead, dear!",
